<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CLASSIFIED // 小姍姍關注組神秘企劃</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0c10;
            --card-bg: #1f2833;
            --accent-color: #66fcf1;
            --text-color: #c5c6c7;
            --highlight: #45a29e;
            --secret-red: #ff4d4d;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(rgba(102, 252, 241, 0.05) 1px, transparent 0);
            background-size: 24px 24px;
        }

        .classified-stamp {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            border: 3px solid var(--secret-red);
            color: var(--secret-red);
            padding: 5px 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            transform: rotate(12deg);
            opacity: 0.8;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.3);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(31, 40, 51, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(102, 252, 241, 0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 15px rgba(102, 252, 241, 0.1);
            position: relative;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-color);
        }

        .header .sub-title {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hint-card {
            background: rgba(11, 12, 16, 0.7);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }

        .hint-card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .hint-card ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .hint-card li {
            margin: 12px 0;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .dates-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .date-box {
            flex: 1;
            background: rgba(69, 162, 158, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--highlight);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .date-box:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(102, 252, 241, 0.3);
        }

        .date-box .day {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .date-box .label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .subscribe-box {
            margin-top: 35px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .subscribe-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .subscribe-input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            background: #0b0c10;
            border: 1px solid var(--highlight);
            border-radius: 25px;
            color: #fff;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .subscribe-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(102, 252, 241, 0.3);
        }

        .subscribe-btn {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), var(--highlight));
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            color: #0b0c10;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(102, 252, 241, 0.4);
        }

        .subscribe-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .dates-container {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .subscribe-form {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .classified-stamp {
                position: static;
                display: inline-block;
                margin-bottom: 15px;
                transform: rotate(0deg);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="classified-stamp">TOP SECRET // 機密</div>

        <div class="header">
            <p class="sub-title">小姍姍關注組 特別企劃</p>
            <h1>PROJECT : UNKNOWN</h1>
        </div>

        <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            各位贊助人，你的訴求我哋聽到啦！📣✨<br>
            團隊正秘密籌備一個全新 Big Project，邀請你率先解鎖！
        </p>

        <!-- 重要日期區塊 -->
        <div class="dates-container">
            <div class="date-box">
                <div class="label">PHASE 1 : 秘密驚喜解鎖</div>
                <div class="day">11 . 08</div>
            </div>
            <div class="date-box">
                <div class="label">PHASE 2 : BIG DAY 正式引爆</div>
                <div class="day">11 . 22</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 神秘提示 -->
        <div class="hint-card">
            <h3>🔍 CONFIDENTIAL HINTS // 神秘線索：</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>⚡ 結合 <strong>動感汗水 x 滋味補給 x 傳遞愛心</strong> 嘅年度盛事</li>
                <li>👟 專為大家而設嘅 <strong>特別體驗企劃</strong>，讓你輕鬆邁步、沿途品嚐！</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 訂閱 / 解鎖動態 -->
        <div class="subscribe-box">
            <p>想搶先掌握第一手情報？立即輸入 Email 訂閱！📩💖</p>
            <form class="subscribe-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('解鎖成功！第一手情報將發送至你的電郵。');">
                <input type="email" class="subscribe-input" placeholder="輸入你的 Email..." required>
                <button type="submit" class="subscribe-btn">SUBSCRIBE</button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>小姍姍關注組 敬上</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
